                <p>Registers a new device in your project and assigns it a system-generated ID. The device must be physically provisioned and powered on before you call this endpoint. The API does not provision hardware; it records it.</p>
                <p>On success, the API returns <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded font-mono">201 Created</code> with the new device object. The initial <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded font-mono">status</code> will be <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded font-mono">provisioning</code> until the device makes its first telemetry ping, after which it transitions to <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded font-mono">online</code>.</p>
